        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>数学题解答</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] },\n      svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #f5f4ef;\n      color: #4c4c48;\n      font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 607px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 0 25px 14px 25px;\n      background: #f7f7f3;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n    .cropped {\n      height: 23px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-top: -12px;\n    }\n    .equation {\n      text-align: center;\n      margin: 2px 0;\n    }\n    p {\n      margin: 5px 0;\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n    .question {\n      color: #39795d;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      margin-right: 8px;\n    }\n    .section {\n      margin-top: 7px;\n    }\n    .matrix-row {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 9px;\n      margin: 2px 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .no-indent { text-indent: 0; }\n    .q-matrix {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin: 6px 0 3px;\n    }\n    .piecewise {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin: 7px 0 0;\n    }\n    mjx-container { margin: 0 !important; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"cropped\">\n      $$\\frac{[?]}{[?]}-\\frac{[?]}{n!}+\\cdots$$\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"equation\">\n      $$=\\sum \\frac{1}{3}\\frac{2^n-(-1)^n}{n!}x^n.$$\n    </div>\n\n    <p>由 $S(x)$ 泰勒级数的唯一性，知 $a_n=\\dfrac{1}{3}[2^n-(-1)^n]$.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"no-indent\"><span class=\"question\">(21) 解</span>（I）由已知 $A=$</p>\n\n      <div class=\"matrix-row\">\n        <span>$$\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-1&amp;-1\\\\-1&amp;0&amp;a\\\\1&amp;a&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}$$</span>\n        <span>与 $A=$</span>\n        <span>$$\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;b\\end{pmatrix}$$</span>\n        <span>相似，由 $0+0+0=$</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <p> $1+1+b$，知 $b=-2$. 故 $A$ 的特征值为 $\\lambda_1=\\lambda_2=1,\\lambda_3=-2$.</p>\n\n      <p>由 $|\\lambda E-A|=-(\\lambda-1)^2(\\lambda+2)=0$，且 $(\\lambda E-A)x=0$，得 $A$ 的特征向量为</p>\n\n      <div class=\"equation\">\n        $$\\alpha_1=(-1,1,0)^T,\\quad \\alpha_2=(1,1,-2)^T\\quad(\\text{已正交}).$$\n      </div>\n\n      <p>由 $(-2E-A)x=0$，得 $A$ 的特征向量为 $\\alpha_3=(1,1,1)^T$. 将 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3$ 单位化，得</p>\n\n      <div class=\"equation\">\n        $$\\gamma_1=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}(-1,1,0)^T,\\quad\n        \\gamma_2=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt6}(1,1,-2)^T,\\quad\n        \\gamma_3=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt3}(1,1,1)^T.$$\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"q-matrix\">\n        <span>$Q=(\\gamma_1,\\gamma_2,\\gamma_3)=$</span>\n        <span>$$\\begin{pmatrix}\n        -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}&amp;\\frac{1}{\\sqrt6}&amp;\\frac{1}{\\sqrt3}\\\\\n        \\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}&amp;\\frac{1}{\\sqrt6}&amp;\\frac{1}{\\sqrt3}\\\\\n        0&amp;-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt6}&amp;\\frac{1}{\\sqrt3}\n        \\end{pmatrix}.$$</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>则 $Q$ 为正交正交矩阵，标准形为 $y_1^2+y_2^2-2y_3^2$.</p>\n\n      <p>（II）由于 $x^Tx=y^Ty=y_1^2+y_2^2+y_3^2=1$ 的条件下，</p>\n\n      <div class=\"equation\">\n        $$f(x_1,x_2,x_3)=x^TAx=y_1^2+y_2^2-2y_3^2\n        =y_1^2+y_2^2+y_3^2-3y_3^2=1-3y_3^2,$$\n      </div>\n\n      <p>所以 $f(x_1,x_2,x_3)$ 在 $x^Tx=1$ 的条件下的最大值为 $1$，最小值为 $-2$.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"no-indent\"><span class=\"question\">(22) 解</span>（I）先求 $f(x)$. 解方程 $f'(x)+\\dfrac{1}{\\lambda}f(x)=0$，得 $f(x)=ce^{-x/\\lambda}$（$c$ 为大于零</p>\n\n      <p>的常数）。由 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\infty f(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^\\infty ce^{-x/\\lambda}\\,dx=1$，得 $c=\\dfrac{1}{\\lambda}$，故</p>\n\n      <div class=\"piecewise\">\n        $$f(x)=\n        \\begin{cases}\n        \\dfrac{1}{\\lambda}e^{-x/\\lambda},&amp;x&gt;0,\\\\\n        0,&amp;x\\leq 0.\n        \\end{cases}$$\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
